cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. The datasets it produces are published under CC BY 4.0."
type: software
title: "Open Prices: extraction of on-chain price data from Ethereum"
abstract: >-
  Extraction scripts and documentation site of the Open Prices datasets: the rounds of seven Chainlink price feeds and
  the swap events of Uniswap V2 and V3, SushiSwap V2 and V3 and Curve pools on Ethereum Mainnet (ETH, LINK, UNI, AAVE,
  COMP, USDC, USDT), with, for every row, its block, transaction, pool liquidity, simulated execution cost and
  extraction fingerprint. The code is under the MIT License; the datasets and the documentation under CC BY 4.0.
authors:
  - family-names: Augusto
    given-names: Stéphane
    affiliation: "HES-SO, HEG Geneva, Deep Mining Lab"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DeepMining-Lab/Open_Price_Infra"
url: "https://fair.deepmining.ch/"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-17"
keywords:
  - on-chain data
  - Ethereum
  - Chainlink
  - Uniswap
  - decentralized exchanges
  - historical prices
  - FAIR data
